  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Disaster Vermin — Innate Technique (1st level)</em></p><blockquote><p>You are born with a disgusting power, with many disgusting possibilities.</p></blockquote><p>Beginning at 1st level, as an action for 2 cursed energy you create an Insect Swarm in a space you can see within 5 ft of you. You can command the swarm as a bonus action, otherwise it takes the dodge action. Your Insect Swarm is made up of actual insects created from your cursed energy, not shikigami and you can only have one Insect Swarm summoned at a time.</p>",
